{
  "$comment": "DRAFT Jamaican Patois red-flag rules (FR-05, PRD 9.1 layer 1). NOT CLINICALLY APPROVED and NOT YET REVIEWED BY A NATIVE SPEAKER: seed list for the local demo only. English rules (en.json) always run as well, because Patois speakers often code-switch, so this file only adds Patois-specific wording. Matching rules are the same as en.json (normalised text, whole words; see en.json $comment). Spelling varies a lot in written Patois; add variants rather than loosening patterns.",
  "language": "jam",
